  "display_title": "This Is the Rabbit You (Didn't) Order",
  "description": "Famous actor Kim Si-Woo is on the verge of being kicked out of the entertainment industry after being framed for drug charges against the third generation of a conglomerate.The problematic \"third generation chaebol\" Jo Eun-Hyun comes to help Si-Woo...\n\n*\"If you hug me every day, I'll let you return to the entertainment industry.\"*\n\nSi-Woo, a prickly but affectionate black panther, and Eun-Hyun, a somewhat sloppy third generation chaebol rabbit, will the two be able to resolve their misunderstandings about each other...?\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
